# Stageshow overlay for this kit

The skill lives at `.agents/skills/stageshow/SKILL.md`. Read it before writing any
faux UI. CoS usage and the don'ts: `docs/stageshow.md`.

## When this applies

The operator asked for a fake or mocked UI, a product demo, a hero or feature-card
illustration, a bento grid, or an animated cursor in an interface — even if they
never said "Stageshow".

## When it does not

`/gm`, `/triage`, `/my-tasks`, `/enrich`, and `/dispatch` stay prose and YAML.
Do not illustrate a briefing. Do not put a Stageshow component in `briefings/` or
`work-log/`. Cursor Canvas is for durable data artifacts beside chat; this is for
React illustrations in the repo.

## Standing orders

1. One idea, one size, one product. Copy the closest gold example; do not sketch
   from a blank file.
2. CLAUDE.md §4 still wins. Publishing a still or a page is a send. Draft, stop.
3. Do not copy this skill into `skills/` or into the install root.
4. Do not ship another product's identity. Restyle the gold to this kit.
5. Film before handing over. A screenshot of the idle frame is not a rehearsal.
